The aim of the SLIM VAT packages is to remove obligations imposed on Polish entrepreneurs that are redundant and obsolete in the digital era. This is the third edition of this package. The SLIM VAT package 3 involves a range of changes that can be grouped for the purposes of this text as:
1) improving the financial liquidity of enterprises;
2) reducing the documentary requirements in international trade;
3) reducing the number of VAT corrections;
4) facilitating invoicing;
5) reducing VAT sanctions and
6) consolidating binding information.
